## Interface: 16001
## Title: Patchwerk Forever: Tracker (Thread)
## Notes: A quest tracker of our own: your quests by zone with distances, your guide's steps, My Route (your own stops in your own order), buttons for quest items, tracked recipes, a collect list and a gathering list, in a list you can move, resize and color. Needs Patchwerk Forever. Type /tracker.
